================ 5. BREAKAGE — disable RLS on idempotency_keys, re-run 1/B verbatim ================
This is what makes the check a check: the statement that returned 0 in 1/B
must return 1 here, or 1/B was measuring nothing.

--- SQL: alter table idempotency_keys disable row level security;
--- SQL: the same cross-account read as 1/B ---
set role courier_app; select cafaye.begin_account('11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111'::uuid);
select count(*) from idempotency_keys where account_id = '22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222';
--- output ---
1
--- exit code: 0 ---
PASS: with the policy off, the cross-account read SUCCEEDS (got '1')

